{"diagram":{"image":{"x":0,"width":200,"y":0,"pngdata":"","height":200},"elements":{"leftChildren":[],"comments":[],"children":[{"parent":"root","children":[{"parent":"d75207964aff0b62","children":[{"parent":"4d557e628b7a229d","children":[],"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"28px"},"id":"a0dba463d099e478","title":"如果去公司了，现在写bug呢， 写出了问题。 怎么办？"},{"parent":"4d557e628b7a229d","children":[],"id":"04030d224afe16fd","title":"不要直接去问leader。 <br>1.应该首先尝试去解决这些问题。 比如打印、 debug 都是在发现bug。 <br>2.可以尝试用AI解决一下。 怀疑AI<br>3.可以去搜一下，之前别人碰到过没有。 CSDN、bing、stackOverflow、google<br>4.建议大家问问同事、同学、道友。 <br>5.leader。<br>"},{"parent":"4d557e628b7a229d","children":[],"id":"8ab9db74ba80e2b6","title":"\"\"\"<br>代码<br>\"\"\"<br>在引号里面的是我的代码。现在，我碰到了一个bug， 比如，现在我对sum预期的值是60，但是最终的结果是3。 帮我检查一下，为什么会出这个问题。<br><br>int num;<br>scanf(\"%d\", &amp;num);<br><br>*****"},{"parent":"4d557e628b7a229d","children":[{"parent":"f2b246532a7a068a","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"19px"},"id":"2bdb7d67c72119c5","title":"有没有一个好的分类方式。&nbsp;怎么知道什么时候直接问，什么时候研究一下再问。&nbsp;"},{"parent":"f2b246532a7a068a","children":[],"id":"7b13f1e5b6c3a159","title":"如果是一些环境问题，比如数据库怎么连，电脑怎么连。&nbsp;互联网上搜不到的。&nbsp;大概率是要要问才能知道的<br>"},{"parent":"f2b246532a7a068a","children":[],"id":"56f8c4503314b418","title":"有一些代码的bug问题，建议先搜索一下再问。&nbsp;"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"font-weight":"bold","font-size":"28px"},"id":"f2b246532a7a068a","title":"有一些问题可以直接问同事，<br>但是有一些建议自己先查查再问<br>"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"4d557e628b7a229d","title":"上课应该好好学习。上课不光会讲一些知识，还会讲一些可能的坑。"},{"parent":"d75207964aff0b62","children":[{"parent":"675f8f4efcb3ea20","children":[],"id":"c696e809c1c5a166","title":"敲的时候，不要把我的代码放左边，自己的放右边。<br>直接照着敲。这样看起来是练习了，但是没达到练习的效果"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"675f8f4efcb3ea20","title":"晚自习的时候，要多敲代码，上课的代码需要敲一下"},{"parent":"d75207964aff0b62","children":[{"parent":"b4602c34c25d6243","children":[{"parent":"8ba29cddb5ff71bf","children":[],"id":"6239a9d4154cb16b","title":"先大后小。 先说大的概念，然后让人在心中有一个大致的印象。 <br><br>数组和链表。 <br>面试官问：简单介绍一下数组和链表。 怎么回答？<br>"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"8ba29cddb5ff71bf","title":"现在代码出错了。&nbsp;程序出错了，建议看一下提示信息。&nbsp;"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"b4602c34c25d6243","title":"学会看提示"}],"collapsed":false,"id":"d75207964aff0b62","title":"学习方法的问题"},{"parent":"root","children":[{"parent":"fdcd45b35cc3eefa","children":[],"id":"728dca5e8183b064","title":"数组是一个线性表。线性表，就是数据是一个接一个的。<br>数组是挨在一起的，每个位置存放的数据类型长度都一样"},{"parent":"fdcd45b35cc3eefa","children":[{"parent":"f1e97f23f8ab0e65","children":[],"id":"7a80d0d5b37d45d7","title":"数组和链表，都是线性表， 线性表就是一个一对一的结构，一个数据后面跟着另一个数据。<br>数组是一块连续的内存空间。 链表是一个分散的内存空间，是靠一个一个的结点存数据，并且存下一个的地址。<br>增删改查。 增加，对于数组，需要挪动数据，将数据往后挪。 链表，只需要找到前驱结点，然后挪指针添加；<br>删除，对于数组， 需要把数据往前挪一位，然后最后那个删掉。 链表， 只需要找到前驱结点，挪指针<br>查，对于数组， 因为有随机访问的特性，所以可以直接得到该下标的地址，去地址取数据， 所以它的速度比较快。"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"f1e97f23f8ab0e65","title":"回答问题的方式"},{"parent":"fdcd45b35cc3eefa","children":[{"parent":"7b6cd5d64c03f48b","children":[],"id":"69075b9a4256995e","title":"数组的优缺点"},{"parent":"7b6cd5d64c03f48b","children":[],"id":"48c7f93234b948a1","title":"链表的优缺点"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"7b6cd5d64c03f48b","title":"数组的优缺点"},{"parent":"fdcd45b35cc3eefa","children":[{"parent":"6f476dd7abbf1fb6","children":[],"id":"2072fcf02d73cdfc","title":"要听懂面试官的问题。&nbsp;"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"6f476dd7abbf1fb6","title":"如果面试官问你数组和链表。"}],"collapsed":false,"id":"fdcd45b35cc3eefa","title":"概述"},{"parent":"root","children":[{"parent":"dc355ad9cd4fae7f","children":[{"parent":"af3ad7db88d4d3d9","children":[],"id":"db2fb28521de4a2b","title":"语法<br>数据类型 数组名[数组的长度];"},{"parent":"af3ad7db88d4d3d9","children":[],"id":"68995fe1f235b7b9","title":"int arr[5];<br>"},{"parent":"af3ad7db88d4d3d9","children":[{"parent":"4980c9f0d1e234c1","children":[],"id":"60522408bd650700","title":"长度只能是常量。<br>要么是字面值常量，要么是宏定义常量"},{"parent":"4980c9f0d1e234c1","children":[],"id":"979d718637cbb758","title":"const修饰也不行。const修饰的叫做只读变量，不叫常量"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"22px"},"id":"4980c9f0d1e234c1","title":"注意"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"af3ad7db88d4d3d9","title":"声明"},{"parent":"dc355ad9cd4fae7f","children":[{"parent":"32bce07ec579a4a5","children":[],"id":"cab099c201fedcc8","title":"给数组里面，初始化（第一次初始化）。<br>如果一个数组，没有手动初始化，里面的值是随机值"},{"parent":"32bce07ec579a4a5","children":[],"id":"6f7e8945075b20aa","title":"数组初始化的方式<br>1.完整初始化<br>2.部分初始化<br>3.全部初始化为0"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"32bce07ec579a4a5","title":"初始化"},{"parent":"dc355ad9cd4fae7f","children":[{"parent":"685afd6f0031f0d3","children":[],"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"19px"},"id":"363ba3f0d2d028b5","title":"ARR_LEN"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"685afd6f0031f0d3","title":"数组的访问、修改。<br>坑<br>循环遍历"},{"parent":"dc355ad9cd4fae7f","children":[{"parent":"7360ef480705cb5c","children":[{"parent":"ebeec0416d995420","children":[],"id":"560f53244f09dc68","title":"在申请大数组的时候，一定要小心。"},{"parent":"ebeec0416d995420","children":[],"id":"6b6b9bbff4f83825","title":"一旦数组的长度超过了1000。不要在这上面申请了"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"ebeec0416d995420","title":"现在声明的数组，在局部变量位置。&nbsp;<br>局部变量是存储在栈上。空间不是很大"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"7360ef480705cb5c","title":"局部变量数组"}],"collapsed":false,"id":"dc355ad9cd4fae7f","title":"使用"},{"parent":"root","children":[{"parent":"34fb945c2e4e13ad","children":[{"parent":"0636459697b788b5","children":[],"id":"4bc196ec13318cf4","title":"要知道什么是二维数组：&nbsp;装一维数组的数组。&nbsp;"}],"collapsed":false,"id":"0636459697b788b5","title":"概述"},{"parent":"34fb945c2e4e13ad","children":[{"parent":"083914e1d62702ac","children":[{"parent":"fb1da6674663b232","children":[],"id":"3dbdb000b381306a","title":"矩阵"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"fb1da6674663b232","title":"数学角度"},{"parent":"083914e1d62702ac","children":[{"parent":"b79ca991dbe5e21b","children":[],"id":"07b3b341ddb485c0","title":"内存是连续的。&nbsp;<br>随机访问。&nbsp;寻址公式"}],"collapsed":false,"id":"b79ca991dbe5e21b","title":"内存角度"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"083914e1d62702ac","title":"二维数组的本质"}],"collapsed":false,"id":"34fb945c2e4e13ad","title":"二维数组"},{"parent":"root","children":[{"parent":"1526e3c4fb137055","children":[],"id":"7b6447173a423fab","title":"是一个只读变量。<br>const int num = 10;<br>num = 888; //&nbsp;改不了<br>scanf可以改"},{"parent":"1526e3c4fb137055","children":[],"id":"efd92b0a30b281e2","title":"防君子，不防小人&nbsp;"},{"parent":"1526e3c4fb137055","children":[],"id":"9829cc473e864581","title":"使用const主要在一些不会被修改的地方。&nbsp;"},{"parent":"1526e3c4fb137055","children":[{"parent":"15963efd8a436550","children":[{"parent":"e26c3599207f9a97","children":[],"id":"2d2e2cf9e7c4e3b6","title":"三个固定的步骤：<br>1.引入头文件 stdlib.h time.h<br>2.设置种子值srand(time(NULL))&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>3.调用rand()&nbsp;得到随机数<br>"},{"parent":"e26c3599207f9a97","children":[{"parent":"3f69c4077d14221e","children":[],"id":"ede0dd8616a3476c","title":"1.伪随机数。&nbsp;种子值是固定的，得到的数据序列是固定的。"},{"parent":"3f69c4077d14221e","children":[{"parent":"bf192d5760b04d00","children":[],"id":"24eb24f4c38fb53d","title":"时间戳是一个通用的概念"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"bf192d5760b04d00","title":"2.时间戳的概念"},{"parent":"3f69c4077d14221e","children":[],"id":"7f671913d4b16801","title":"3.不要反复设置种子值"},{"parent":"3f69c4077d14221e","children":[],"id":"6fbb92d35f3a3ba2","title":"4.范围要知道一下。&nbsp;"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"3f69c4077d14221e","title":"细节"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e26c3599207f9a97","title":"1.怎么在C语言中生成随机数。&nbsp;"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"15963efd8a436550","title":"随机发牌"}],"collapsed":false,"id":"1526e3c4fb137055","title":"const"}],"root":true,"theme":"theme_wps_def","showWatermark":false,"id":"root","title":"Day04_数组","version":236,"structure":"mind"}},"meta":{"exportTime":"2025-05-14 21:32:17","member":"","diagramInfo":{"creator":"","created":"","modified":"","title":"","category":""},"id":"","type":"ProcessOn Schema File","version":"1.0"}}